  "abstract_summary": "A memory system that gives every record a provenance link does not thereby ensure the corrective record is consulted. An agent inheriting more consolidated beliefs than it can re-derive must choose a few links to follow before it acts, so the reliability question is not whether provenance exists but which links get...",
